<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103974" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῑμ-έω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμάω</span>
			, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).962.39
			</span></i> (Cotyrta, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμεῖν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.952.16
			</span></i> (Acragas, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				5(1).1432.41
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Messene</span>); part.fem.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμίονσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					5150.22
				</span></i>
			 (Crete, found at Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); masc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμέοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					637.6
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>):—in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.39
			</span></i> all codd. have <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-τιμέων</span>;
			similar forms in the Ionic writings of <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Dom.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Astr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>).</div>
